t:</span></p><p begin="0:51.572" end="0:58.643" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:51.572" end="0:52.750">Pace</span> <span begin="0:52.750" end="0:53.339">în</span> <span begin="0:53.339" end="0:54.518">suflet</span> <span begin="0:54.518" end="0:58.643">mi-așează;</span></p><p begin="0:58.643" end="1:05.714" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:58.643" end="0:59.821">Lângă</span> <span begin="0:59.821" end="1:01.589">Isus</span> <span begin="1:01.589" end="1:02.178">am</span> <span begin="1:02.178" end="1:05.714">biruit</span></p><p begin="1:05.714" end="1:16.485" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.714" end="1:06.303">Și</span> <span begin="1:06.303" end="1:08.660">veșnicia</span> <span begin="1:08.660" end="1:16.485">urmează!</span></p><p begin="1:16.485" end="1:23.343" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:16.485" end="1:17.628">Lângă</span> <span begin="1:17.628" end="1:19.342">Isus</span> <span begin="1:19.342" end="1:19.914">astăzi</span> <span begin="1:19.914" end="1:20.486">n-am</span> <span begin="1:20.486" end="1:21.057">nici</span> <span begin="1:21.057" end="1:21.629">o</span> <span begin="1:21.629" end="1:23.343">teamă,</span></p><p begin="1:23.343" end="1:30.202" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:23.343" end="1:24.487">Lesne</span> <span begin="1:24.487" end="1:25.058">îmi</span> <span begin="1:25.058" end="1:25.630">port</span> <span begin="1:25.630" end="1:26.773">crucea,</span> <span begin="1:26.773" end="1:27.344">făr’</span> <span begin="1:27.344" end="1:27.916">a</span> <span begin="1:27.916" end="1:30.202">cârti...</span></p><p begin="1:30.202" end="1:37.061" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:30.202" end="1:30.774">Al</span> <span begin="1:30.774" end="1:31.345">Său</span> <span begin="1:31.345" end="1:32.489">Cuvânt</span> <span begin="1:32.489" end="1:33.632">către</span> <span begin="1:33.632" end="1:34.203">cer</span> <span begin="1:34.203" end="1:34.775">mă</span> <span begin="1:34.775" end="1:37.061">îndeamnă:</span></p><p begin="1:37.061" end="1:45.020" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:37.061" end="1:37.633">„Mergi</span> <span begin="1:37.633" end="1:39.919">înainte,</span> <span begin="1:39.919" end="1:40.490">cu</span> <span begin="1:40.490" end="1:41.062">El,</span> <span begin="1:41.062" end="1:42.205">orice-ar</span> <span begin="1:42.205" end="1:45.020">fi!”</span></p><p begin="1:45.020" end="1:51.604" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:45.020" end="1:46.117">Lângă</span> <span begin="1:46.117" end="1:48.312">Isus</span> <span begin="1:48.312" end="1:48.861">sunt</span> <span begin="1:48.861" end="1:51.604">fericit:</span></p><p begin="1:51.604" end="1:58.189" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:51.604" end="1:52.702">Pace</span> <span begin="1:52.702" end="1:53.251">în</span> <span begin="1:53.251" end="1:54.348">suflet</span> <span begin="1:54.348" end="1:58.189">mi-așează;</span></p><p begin="1:58.189" end="2:04.773" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:58.189" end="1:59.286">Lângă</span> <span begin="1:59.286" end="2:00.932">Isus</span> <span begin="2:00.932" end="2:01.481">am</span> <span begin="2:01.481" end="2:04.773">biruit</span></p><p begin="2:04.773" end="2:13.678" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:04.773" end="2:05.322">Și</span> <span begin="2:05.322" end="2:07.517">veșnicia</span> <span begin="2:07.517" end="2:13.678">urmează!</span></p><p begin="2:13.678" end="2:20.164" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:13.678" end="2:14.759">Lângă</span> <span begin="2:14.759" end="2:16.380">Isus</span> <span begin="2:16.380" end="2:16.651">simt</span> <span begin="2:16.651" end="2:18.002">nespusă</span> <span begin="2:18.002" end="2:20.164">plăcere,</span></p><p begin="2:20.164" end="2:26.649" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:20.164" end="2:20.704">Cu</span> <span begin="2:20.704" end="2:21.245">El</span> <span begin="2:21.245" end="2:21.785">voi</span> <span begin="2:21.785" end="2:22.866">merge</span> <span begin="2:22.866" end="2:23.406">în</span> <span begin="2:23.406" end="2:25.028">fiece</span> <span begin="2:25.028" end="2:26.649">zi;</span></p><p begin="2:26.649" end="2:33.135" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:26.649" end="2:27.730">Până</span> <span begin="2:27.730" end="2:28.271">ce</span> <span begin="2:28.271" end="2:29.352">viața</span> <span begin="2:29.352" end="2:30.433">Hristos</span> <span begin="2:30.433" end="2:30.973">mi-o</span> <span begin="2:30.973" end="2:31.514">va</span> <span begin="2:31.514" end="2:33.135">cere,</span></p><p begin="2:33.135" end="2:42.821" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:33.135" end="2:33.676">Merg</span> <span begin="2:33.676" end="2:34.216">prin</span> <span begin="2:34.216" end="2:35.837">credință</span> <span begin="2:35.837" end="2:36.378">și</span> <span begin="2:36.378" end="2:36.918">voi</span> <span begin="2:36.918" end="2:42.821">birui!</span></p><p begin="2:42.821" end="2:49.696" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:42.821" end="2:43.967">Lângă</span> <span begin="2:43.967" end="2:46.258">Isus</span> <span begin="2:46.258" end="2:46.831">sunt</span> <span begin="2:46.831" end="2:49.696">fericit:</span></p><p begin="2:49.696" end="2:56.571" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:49.696" end="2:50.841">Pace</span> <span begin="2:50.841" end="2:51.414">în</span> <span begin="2:51.414" end="2:52.560">suflet</span> <span begin="2:52.560" end="2:56.571">mi-așează;</span></p><p begin="2:56.571" end="3:03.445" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:56.571" end="2:57.716">Lângă</span> <span begin="2:57.716" end="2:59.435">Isus</span> <span begin="2:59.435" end="3:00.008">am</span> <span begin="3:00.008" end="3:03.445">biruit</span></p><p begin="3:03.445" end="3:07.456" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:03.445" end="3:04.018">Și</span> <span begin="3:04.018" end="3:06.310">veșnicia</span> <span begin="3:06.310" end="3:07.456">urmează!</span></p></div></body></tt>